## Completion and handoff

**01.W01** The native desktop replays pointer hit and drag, the queued physics toggle, Area attraction and independent gravity. The Sand stopped 0.277 canvas units from its target. Both bodies slept and the foreign workspace kept its position after reopening. Catch-up physics now evaluates spatial Area forces at each fixed step. Three separate wall-clock runs provide frame, input, idle CPU, memory and graphics observations. [November replay, findings and reproduction steps](../../../../fixtures/workspace/stage01/resumption-2026-11-22/README.md)

**01.W02** The fixture checker reopened ten cases and five roots. All 19 asset sizes, hashes and rights declarations were checked. Independent GLB vertex bounds and node scales gave the expected 40 mm ball and 7 mm feature. [Input review](../../../../fixtures/workspace/stage01/resumption-2026-11-22/input-review.json) · [Fixture check](../../../../fixtures/workspace/stage01/resumption-2026-11-22/fixture.json)

**01.W03** The 49 first-consumer decisions and B33–B36 hosting specifications retain their original phase and authority owners. B37 remains deferred. [Proof scope and test results](../../../../fixtures/workspace/stage01/resumption-2026-11-22/README.md)

